title Cassette (deck, 640x480 at 11.3 px/mm): the save box with buttons of the toolkit touch target, then the confirm box
sizes 640x480
ppmm 1130
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_DEMO_PAGE trim
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
tap "SAVE"
wait 400
expect text "SAVE AS NEW FILES"
shot deck-save
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
tap "REPLACE ORIGINAL"
wait 400
expect text "Delete the original take?"
shot deck-confirm
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
